{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is Demo of purgatory flowers. Only contains the first chapter of the story, save and load features are not supported. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo version supports only Korean. However, in the main game, we will support various languages, including Japanese, Chinese, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a model prisoner taking care of 'security risks' in hell. Your daily routine is simple. Guide a new prisoner, and take them into a cell. While living that boring life, you finally make a decision. To escape to purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But you step into a forbidden room by mistake.\u00a0</strong>In that room, the most dangerous prisoners, called the 'Flowers', are incarcerated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now choose. Either take their hand and escape to purgatory, or close the door as if nothing has ever happened.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718780?t=1746643084","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718780?t=1746643084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718780/fa6c9d13337b90aa62441f75e3d59a0379e9bd81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746643084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718780/fa6c9d13337b90aa62441f75e3d59a0379e9bd81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746643084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is Demo of purgatory flowers. Only contains the first chapter of the story, save and load features are not supported. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo version supports only Korean. However, in the main game, we will support various languages, including Japanese, Chinese, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a model prisoner taking care of 'security risks' in hell. Your daily routine is simple. Guide a new prisoner, and take them into a cell. While living that boring life, you finally make a decision. To escape to purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But you step into a forbidden room by mistake.\u00a0</strong>In that room, the most dangerous prisoners, called the 'Flowers', are incarcerated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now choose. Either take their hand and escape to purgatory, or close the door as if nothing has ever happened.</p>","developers":["vivid selfish"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3540550","name":"Purgatory\u2019s Flower"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718780/22732725fccc7a00aa6b68e948b00bccf1a0fb0c/header.jpg?t=1746643084","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134232,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134232/movie480.mp4?t=1746643082","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134232/movie_max.mp4?t=1746643082"},"name":" Purgatory\u2019s Flower ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134232/28c05e09f6594af9ac258f28498d2608e6349908/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746643082","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257